<li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump Failure Turned On</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resets/Restarts Go To Your Current Section</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immortal</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1600 Stockfish Elo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump Failure Turned On</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resets/Restarts Go To The Beginning Of The Level</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your chess skills to checkmate Stockfish and gain a power up to help you navigate difficult boards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550290/extras/ba5c591f8c1f1589114b6e740bf64fcc.poster.avif?t=1751223199\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550290/extras/ba5c591f8c1f1589114b6e740bf64fcc.webm?t=1751223199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Stacks</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game mode is similar to the Adventure mode but it is more puzzle based and much shorter. There are seven boards stacked straight on top of each other. Climb them as quick as you can! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three main stacks:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern Classics - Games from recent history,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Influencers - Famous games played by internet celebrities, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless - Procedurally generated games based on a seed value</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550290/extras/115e02d919b71f773104f4a9d11753b7.poster.avif?t=1751223199\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550290/extras/115e02d919b71f773104f4a9d11753b7.webm?t=1751223199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Highscores</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing each Adventure Mode and Stacks maps will enter you into a highscores list with your fastest time. If you are the fastest player to complete a level your name will be displayed on the crown at the top of each level for everyone else to see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550290/extras/aa7bd1e8c2f458da23ca4d75c8c7ba0b.poster.avif?t=1751223199\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550290/extras/aa7bd1e8c2f458da23ca4d75c8c7ba0b.webm?t=1751223199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Disclaimer:  This game is not associated with or endorsed by a board game called &quot;Who Wears The Crown?&quot; by Blue Heron Entertainment LLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
